{
  "$schema": "https://aka.ms/codetour-schema",
  "title": "08 - Router and entity loader",
  "description": "The first two nodes: how a question gets a route, and how your real accounts are loaded so the AI can't invent IDs.",
  "nextTour": "09 - The specialist",
  "steps": [
    {
